Root cause:
The bug was caused by the incorrect handling of the variable `i`, which was declared outside of the loop and not properly incremented within the loop. This led to the check on `i` not functioning as intended, potentially causing the loop to run indefinitely or not at all, thus affecting the logic of the `FindLength` function.

